{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51972","headline":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 三 · 吕岩","name":"西江月（六首。以下词）（原八首，前二首已见《全唐诗》，此六首，《全宋词》亦未收。） 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"听说金公两字，何物唤作金孙。\n寻枝寻叶必知根，无智便乃心昏。\n若用凡铅爲体，都来少魄无魂。\n水银渐结必难存，秘诀要处谁论。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"吕岩","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_51972.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_51972","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}